    <string name="settings_help_body">Settings and activity\n\nSaved — review the posts you saved.\nArchive — every story you have shared, including expired ones.\nAccount privacy — choose who can see your content.\nTheme — switch between Light, Dark and System default.\n\nFor anything else, use the Diagnostics screen from a debug build.</string>
